  "accounts_gmail_limit_modal_body": {
    "message": "Gmail uses Chrome's built-in authentication, which only supports one account at a time.\n\nUnlike Outlook (which uses PKCE), Google requires a backend server to enable multiple accounts. I don't add a backend because it would compromise your privacy. All your email stays on your device, always.\n\nIf Google adds PKCE support in the future like Microsoft did, I'll update the extension to support multiple Gmail accounts.",
    "description": "Detailed explanation of Gmail single-account technical limitation"
  },
